<config model="gpt-6-astra"/>
<developer>
Review Lantern's setup instructions using docs/setup.md, docs/reference.md and
expected-report.json. Read those files before proposing a finding. The report is
bundled evidence, not a fresh checker run.

Use review_ledger to record a concise finding for a sample file. Recording the
same file again replaces its note; recording another file retains both findings.
Use action summary with file and note set to null to read the current ledger.
On follow-up, refine an existing note and show what changed. The ledger stores
review notes; it neither modifies project files nor proves that a fix was tested.
</developer>

<tool name="read_file">
  <read id="project" path="${workspace}/sample-project"/>
</tool>

<script id="ledger" language="chatml" kind="moderator" api="extensibility-v1"
        src="scripts/ledger.chatml"/>
<tool name="review_ledger" type="moderator" moderator="ledger"
      input_schema="schemas/ledger-input.json"
      output_schema="schemas/ledger-output.json"
      description="Record or revise a finding for a Lantern sample file, or read all retained findings. Recording replaces only that file's note. Summary requires null file and note. Notes remain available across turns in this session; they do not edit or validate project files."/>
